    "title": "Thai bloggers share heartwarming moment with squirrel in Shangri-La",
    "text": "On Tuesday, Thai bloggers Natthavipa Phuvichayakarn and Patomporn Ruyun had heartwarming interactions with a squirrel at Pudacuo National Park in Shangri-La, Yunnan province. The squirrel played freely with the visitors.\nPhuvichayakarn and Ruyun were among 10 bloggers who visited Kunming, Lijiang, and Shangri-La from Friday to Wednesday. During their trip, they savored delicious cuisine and took in the stunning landscapes while experiencing the region's harmonious coexistence between humanity and nature.",
